          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Zettelkasten Method:** An exploration of the principles of atomicity, autonomy, and linking developed by Niklas Luhmann, which forms the theoretical basis for modern atomic note-taking.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 75,
          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Evergreen Notes:** A study of the principles behind writing durable, concept-oriented notes that are designed to evolve and compound in value over time.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 77,
          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Cognitive Load Theory:** An investigation into the psychological principles that explain why managing information in \"chunks\" (as MOCs allow) is essential for effective learning and thinking.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 78,
          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Progressive Summarization:** A look at the specific technique for processing literature notes, which often serves as the raw material for synthesizing ideas within an MOC.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 79,
          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The \"Linking Your Thinking\" (LYT) Framework:** An analysis of the specific, popular methodology that heavily operationalizes the concept of MOCs as the primary interface for a PKB.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 80,
          "source": "topic-set_moc's_cognitive-psychology,-information-science,-and-practical-creative-work__🆔20251019015414.md"
        }
      ]
